<div class="content">
    <h2>Welcome to Yoruba Learning Hub, {{name}}! 👋</h2>
    
    <p>We're thrilled to have you join our community of Yoruba language learners and enthusiasts. Here's what you can do now that you're registered:</p>
    
    <div style="background: rgba(249, 250, 251, 0.7); border-radius: 8px; padding: 20px; margin: 25px 0;">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #4f46e5;">Get Started</h3>
        <ul style="padding-left: 20px; margin: 10px 0;">
            <li>Complete your profile to get personalized recommendations</li>
            <li>Explore our interactive lessons and resources</li>
            <li>Join our community discussions</li>
            <li>Book your first live session with our expert teachers</li>
        </ul>
