    <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to reach out to our support team at <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #4f46e5; text-decoration: none;">{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>
    
    <p>Happy Learning!<br>The Yoruba Learning Hub Team</p>
